1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
A PIXEL PARABLE: JESUS & A DINOSAUR

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A QUIET SAIL BEFORE THE RAIN...

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
JESUS: Why do humans keep changing?

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
DINO: Over generations, traits that help survival spread.

5
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
DINO: Whoa! This rain evolved fast!

6
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
JESUS: Our bodies change. What of our hearts?

7
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
DINO: Maybe we grow kinder, choice by choice.

8
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.000
KEEP GROWING KINDER.

